{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "host": "first-chat-preview.app-dev.capiro.ai",
  "note": "Shared by infra/cdk/lib/preview/first-chat-core.ts and the offline first-match model. Compact Core POST 1, GET 2 and host-only guard 3 precede the native-operations POST 3 packet. Native memory owner POST and client record method rules require separate readback-verified listener priorities ahead of the same retained guard; no shared listener priority or unused slot is assumed.",
